<h3>🐧 Linux Modern vs Legacy Commands</h3>
<p>Quick reference for transitioning from legacy networking commands to modern alternatives.</p>
<div class="command-grid">
<div class="command-box">
<h4>✅ Modern (ip/ss commands)</h4>
<code>ip addr show</code>
<code>ip link show</code>
<code>ip route show</code>
<code>ss -tuln</code>
</div>
<div class="command-box">
<h4>⚠️ Legacy (ifconfig/netstat)</h4>
<code>ifconfig</code>
<code>ifconfig -a</code>
<code>route -n</code>
<code>netstat -tulnp</code>
</div>
</div>
